The U-Bahn arrives.
It is bright yellow.
The train stops at the platform.
The doors open.
First the other passengers get out.
I wait briefly on the platform.
Then I get in.
I have to travel far today.
I usually like travelling with the U-Bahn.
There is a loud beep.
The doors close quickly.
The train departs.
We ride straight into the dark tunnel.
I look for a seat.
I see a free seat by the window.
I sit down.
I take my backpack off.
I hold the backpack on my lap.
Now I can relax.
